    "Scan of the 1979 edition of the Sea Island, Georgia, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1974; field checked in 1975; photo inspected in 1985; last revised in 1979; printed in 1991.",
